what's going on guys in this video i've  selected  five characters from black clover and  we're going to examine what it would be  like if they were born  in the micro academia universe instead  if you've watched both series you'll  know there's a massive difference  in the power systems of black clover and  my hero academia so that means in this  video there will be  no spirits no devils and definitely no  grimoires involved  if we can get this video to 5 000 likes  then i'll drop a part 2 with different  characters from black clover  as soon as humanly possible don't forget  to sub for more anime crossovers like  this  and remember i do a live commentary of  black clover and my hero chapters  every sunday on twitch to start things  off we have the pro hero  known as blackout aka yami sukihiro  yami is a 28 year old pro hero who ranks  83rd on the charts  and his quirk is called dark matter this  power grants him the ability to generate  darkness  and manipulate it in various ways at its  most basic level  this quirk enables him to cancel out all  light sources  within a 200 meter radius whether it be  light bulbs candles  phones or anything else if something  generates light then dark matter can  stop it from doing so  making yami a really useful hero when it  comes to raids  or stealth missions he always carries a  trusty katana as a support item  which he can then charge up with  darkness that he generates from his body  this allows him to perform a wide  variety of dark powered slashes and  thrusts  capable of tearing the fabric of space  he's also able to use darkness to  restrain his enemies  and maneuver himself around which is not  too dissimilar from another character in  this universe  yami also has a black hole technique in  which he generates enough dark matter to  create an  endless void that absorbs enemy attacks  this is the ultimate defense against  long-range quirks  and can protect yami and his allies as  attacks are immediately  sucked into it th